: Remove Spaces/Line Breaks&#xa;Test Each Alternative Gold" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2080" y="368" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="Assign Released Binary Row Score&#xa;Any Normalized Gold Is a&#xa;Prediction Substring → 1&#xa;Otherwise → 0" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2320" y="368" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="Sum Five Component Counts&#xa;Recognition 300 · Scene VQA 200&#xa;Document VQA 200 · KIE 200&#xa;HMER 100&#xa;Total Score: 0–1,000" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2560" y="368" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="Source and Release Boundary&#xa;arXiv v7 4cc667… · Repo 86d091…&#xa;JSON df7595… · HF 92a54b…&#xa;Short Gold Alternatives Exist&#xa;MIT Code · Upstream Data Rights" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2800" y="632" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=0;convertToSvg=1;strokeColor=#424242;strokeWidth